@startuml Payment Workflow - Activity Diagram

title Payment Workflow - Activity Diagram

|#LightBlue|**Buyer**|
start
:Auction ends, buyer wins;

:View order details;

:Click pay button;

|#LightGreen|**System**|
:Check order exists and status;

if (Order valid?) then (No)
  |#LightBlue|**Buyer**|
  :Return error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|#LightGreen|**System**|
:Check order status is awaiting_payment;

if (Status valid?) then (No)
  |#LightBlue|**Buyer**|
  :Return error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|#LightGreen|**System**|
:Create payment link via PayOS API;

:Save payment record with status pending;

:Return payment link to buyer;

|#LightBlue|**Buyer**|
:Redirect to PayOS payment page;

:Complete payment on PayOS;

|#LightYellow|**PayOS**|
:Process payment;

:Send webhook to system;

|#LightGreen|**System**|
:Receive webhook from PayOS;

:Validate webhook signature;

if (Webhook valid?) then (No)
  :Return error;
  stop
else (Yes)
endif

|#LightGreen|**System**|
if (Payment status?) then (PAID)
  :Update payment status to paid_held;
  
  :Update order status to awaiting_shipment;
  
  :Notify seller payment received;
  
  |#LightBlue|**Buyer**|
  :Payment successful;
  stop
  
elseif (CANCELLED) then
  :Update payment status to cancelled;
  
  |#LightBlue|**Buyer**|
  :Payment cancelled;
  stop
  
else (PENDING)
  :Keep payment status as pending;
  
  |#LightBlue|**Buyer**|
  :Payment pending;
  stop
endif

@enduml



















